WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.550
Say what the letter stands for, then write the expression.

2
00:00:04.227 --> 00:00:08.352
A hall costs sixty dollars, plus five dollars for each guest.

3
00:00:08.931 --> 00:00:11.381
Let g stand for the number of guests.

4
00:00:12.134 --> 00:00:16.559
g guests cost five g. Add the hire: five g plus sixty.

5
00:00:17.338 --> 00:00:21.638
Test it: ten guests cost fifty plus sixty: one hundred and ten.

6
00:00:23.629 --> 00:00:27.329
The same expression gives the cost for any number of guests.
